      "message": "Does this still hold true ?\nISTM that if a caller updates the UIDs, this gets called, and if in the ensuing rematchAllNetworksAndRequests the network goes to the foreground or to the background then this is reentered. I don\u0027t think you\u0027ll get an infinite loop because updateUids here will give the same results as previously and you\u0027ll enter the other branch of this if in the second pass, but it\u0027s pretty difficult to think about what happens if this is called in the middle of itself.\n\nI\u0027m too sleepy at this moment to be sure ; I\u0027ll try to take another look after I sleep, but to my tired brain this is what looks scary right now.",
