      "message": "\u003e Does this still hold true?\n\nI think it still holds, since uids also shouldn\u0027t be changed by rematchAllNetworksAndRequests. Or am I missing something?\n\nAlso AFAICT VPN is never a background network, so I don\u0027t think this will actually happen.",
