      "writtenOn": "2019-01-10T14:39:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No objections to the logic but I think it would be a bit easier to understand if this paralleled the way it\u0027s done for LinkProperties. As you obviously noticed you can\u0027t just make this updateNetworkCapabilitiesInPlaceIfPossible and add it with \u0026\u0026 to the test because if this new function ever says no then we\u0027d end up having sent a wrong LP.\n\nBut what you could do is to move the contents of the current updateLP to a new function that returns an LP, create a symmetric updateNC function, and have both be called by a new updateLPAndNCInPlaceIfPossible. That function would call both, and only if both are okay then send both the LP and the NC, and return true or false the way updateLPInPlaceIfPossible does today.",
